Glacies, the Lady of Winter, came from the fairy world worried about the Tree of Life, which is freezing. For that reason, the temperature has dropped again. Not even the fairies could fight the glacial lava.
Glacies found the sources of the river in the Snowstorm Dragon's lair and in the Snow Lady's Ice Palace. But she was nearly defeated by the Snow Lady. To put our plan in motion, we have to draw them out of their refuges.

First, use the Incubator to get a Kelvezu Egg.

[Challenge Objective]

Activate the Incubator in the marked area and defeat Kelvezu to obtain the Kelvezu Egg. Then talk to Derik in Ricarten.
